draft the board resolution and Certificate of Amendment.

.why = Delaware requires a Certificate of Amendment to change authorized shares. the board resolution authorizes it.

---

## board resolution

create a written consent that:
1. approves the reverse stock split (X:1 ratio)
2. approves reduction of authorized shares to ≤ 5,000
3. authorizes officers to file the Certificate of Amendment

template structure:
```
ACTION BY UNANIMOUS WRITTEN CONSENT
OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF [COMPANY], INC.

RESOLVED: that a reverse stock split of [RATIO]:1 is approved...
RESOLVED: that authorized shares be reduced to [NUMBER]...
RESOLVED: that officers are authorized to file Certificate of Amendment...

Signature: _______________
Date: _______________
```

---

## Certificate of Amendment

Delaware form: https://corp.delaware.gov/

required fields:
| field | value |
|-------|-------|
| corporation name | |
| file number | |
| article amended | (typically Article 4 - capital stock) |
| new text | "authorized to issue [X] shares of Common Stock, par value $[Y] per share" |

---

## emit

save drafts to:
- `$route/2.draft.board-resolution.yield.md`
- `$route/2.draft.certificate-of-amendment.yield.md`
